\begin{lemma}
\label{lem:qld-win-implications}
Assume that $\strategy$ succeeds in $\game^\pauli_\qldparams$ with probability at least $1-\eps$, for some $\eps\geq 0$. Then the following hold: 
	\begin{enumerate}
